---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getLastUpdated } from '../lib/updated';

const LAST_UPDATED = getLastUpdated();
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What information this site collects, why, and how to request it be removed."
>
  <section>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated-note">Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}</p>
    <p>
      This page explains what information kseniiashermin.com collects, why, and how you
      can ask me to change or delete it. This is a personal site run by one person
      (Kseniia Shermin), not a company with a dedicated legal or privacy team, so this
      policy is written in plain language rather than formal legal terms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <h3>The contact form</h3>
    <p>
      If you fill out the form on the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>, it collects
      your name, email address, approximate ad spend range, what you're looking for, and
      whatever you write in the message field. That submission is processed by
      Web3Forms (a third-party form service) and delivered to me by email. I use it only
      to reply to your inquiry. I don't add you to a mailing list, sell it, or share it
      with anyone else.
    </p>
    <h3>Booking a call</h3>
    <p>
      The "Book a Call" link goes to Cal.com, a third-party scheduling tool. Anything you
      enter there (name, email, meeting time) is handled under
      <a href="https://cal.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cal.com's own privacy policy</a>,
      not this one.
    </p>
    <h3>Analytics</h3>
    <p>
      This site uses Google Analytics 4 and Microsoft Clarity to understand traffic and
      how visitors use the site. Both use cookies and only load after you accept the
      cookie banner. If you decline or don't respond, neither loads, and no analytics
      cookies are set. It may also use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is cookie-free and
      doesn't require consent.
    </p>
    <h3>Hosting</h3>
    <p>
      This site is served through Cloudflare. Like virtually all web hosts, Cloudflare's
      infrastructure sees standard server-log data (IP address, browser type, request
      timestamps) for every visitor, as a normal part of delivering the page. I don't
      access this data individually; it exists at the infrastructure level.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What this site does not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Doesn't sell or rent your information to anyone.</li>
      <li>Doesn't share contact-form submissions with third parties beyond the services listed above (Web3Forms, to deliver the message to me).</li>
      <li>Doesn't run retargeting or ad-tracking pixels.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask me at any time to tell you what information I have about you, correct
      it, or delete it. The fastest way to reach me is through the
      <a href="/contact">Contact form</a> or a message on
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kseniiashermin/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>.
      I'll respond within a reasonable time.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If what this site collects or how it's used changes, this page will be updated to
      reflect that. The date at the top shows the last update.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
